OL,3,ASouth African airline defends
OL,4,Alow-altitude aerial stunt over packed
OL,5,Astadium
OL,6,
OL,7,FA South African airline has defended
OL,8,Fitself against some criticism of a
OL,9,Fdramatic stunt that saw two of its
OL,10,Faircraft in close formation fly
OL,11,Freportedly within feet of the top of a
OL,12,Fstadium.
OL,14,FThe jets roared over Cape Town's DHL
OL,15,FStadium, filled with more than 50,000
OL,16,Ffans, as smoke flares shot up before
OL,17,Fthe start of a rugby match featuring
OL,18,Ffierce rivals South Africa and New
OL,19,FZealand.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
